## OpenCode-specific notes

The mpm-opencode plugin's `experimental.chat.system.transform`
hook handles wake-context injection automatically — you do not
need to call `read_wake_context` manually at session start.

The plugin stamps provenance for every MPM call:
`framework_name=opencode`, with `model_name` and
`invocation_id` set per call.

Host-specific recovery details (OpenCode plugin lifecycle,
system-prompt transformation quirks) are documented in the
plugin's README.
